# Unit pyramid: 1x1 base on XZ at y=0, apex at y=1.
# The quad base exercises fan triangulation; sides use explicit normals (v//vn).
v -0.5 0.0 -0.5
v  0.5 0.0 -0.5
v  0.5 0.0  0.5
v -0.5 0.0  0.5
v  0.0 1.0  0.0
vn  0.0 -1.0  0.0
vn  0.0  0.4472  0.8944
vn  0.8944  0.4472  0.0
vn  0.0  0.4472 -0.8944
vn -0.8944  0.4472  0.0
# base (quad, facing down)
f 1//1 2//1 3//1 4//1
# sides
f 4//2 3//2 5//2
f 3//3 2//3 5//3
f 2//4 1//4 5//4
f 1//5 4//5 5//5
